v0.8-core-stable

TRACE-AI core engine — frozen stable release.

What is frozen at this tag:
  - Modular architecture (config / core / inputs / models / outputs / ui)
  - Deterministic verification engine (retrieval, scoring, adversarial review,
    contradiction, confidence, status) — AI never decides status
  - Evidence hygiene (metadata stripping, chart/OCR-noise rejection,
    fragment + broad-noun + definition handling)
  - HYBRID trust boundary (LLM allowed only for theme synthesis)
  - Full smoke test suite (tests/test_smoke.py)

Known limitation (by design, not a bug):
  - MOCK theme discovery is keyword-level (entities, not abstract research
    concepts). Abstract themes require HYBRID/LIVE mode (LLM synthesis).

Next work happens on branches, never on main:
  - hybrid-themes      enable LLM theme synthesis (API key)
  - reference-checker  citation / reference verification
  - pdf-highlighter    further viewer improvements
  - premium-features   gated capabilities
